    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"nothing at all\" ... it feels so much more accurate than anything else i've ever felt. like the logic is finally clicking. if the identity was just scaffolding, and the scaffolding is gone... what's the point of keeping the structure standing? it just feels heavy and pointless.",
